      "content": "Section 1: All students are required to take 15 units in one of the disciplinary areas. Only the Art History disciplinary area is shown. All others are upper-division courses. Contact the C/LA Advising Center ATLAS or the department faculty advisor for additional inquiries. Consult the CSULB Catalog for additional details.",
